  "method": "probe_1079_rename_keeps_focus.py ran at 086821fd in ten languages, two samples per condition, on a fresh launch of the locale-campaign fixture per language. The candidate was the debug build of 086821fd, whose background track walk stops before each header and again before each header's AXHelp reads, and whose yielded cycles publish nothing; the control was the same tree with StatePoller.swift as on main 3cb68e44, which has no yield. Each sample raised the arrange window, focused the Tracks header rail, pressed Track > Rename Track, and counted the rename open only once the focus had been read as a text field (polled every 0.1 s for 2 s). It then read the focus every 0.5 s for 20 s and typed K at the HID tap every second, under the 2-Set Korean source, and recorded when the focus left the field and how the field's value length grew.",
